Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.81,0:00:05.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The next one's on its way. We play!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.67,0:00:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aaaaah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.93,0:00:15.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Parry!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.57,0:00:26.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The more time I can buy, the\Nbetter chance they have to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.69,0:00:30.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just going to run around and\Nparry every single thing I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.59,0:00:38.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was finally able to stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.99,0:00:44.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.03,0:00:46.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's this old-timer?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.27,0:00:59.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.05,0:01:02.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love the world. I
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.95,0:01:09.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.65,0:01:11.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,think
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.56,0:01:13.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.67,0:01:16.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love my inspiration.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.37,0:01:17.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.97,0:01:20.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What I want to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.93,0:01:22.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What I want to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.33,0:01:24.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What I want to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.27,0:01:29.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go back to the end of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.71,0:01:34.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's back to the end of the day,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.39,0:01:40.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't be able to reach\Nthe end of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.27,0:01:43.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go back to the end of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.41,0:01:46.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go back to the end of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.95,0:02:23.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sparkly gold armor and sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.17,0:02:26.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even the horse has a\Nwhole sparkly gold outfit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.45,0:02:30.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would he be standing in\Na war zone looking all fancy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.09,0:02:33.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe the poor guy is lost or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.55,0:02:35.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.35,0:02:38.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.83,0:02:41.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now's not the time to get distracted. Nor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.67,0:02:48.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't stand a chance\Nif these soldiers gather
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.05,0:02:51.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,up their weapons and\Ncome at me all at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.67,0:02:56.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll have to keep parrying them, keep\Ntheir weapons out of their hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.91,0:03:00.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not sure what that is,\Nbut I'm gonna get it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.29,0:03:17.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still can't help but wonder what\Nthis old guy's doing out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.91,0:03:19.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the devil just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.59,0:03:20.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.50,0:03:23.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't give the soldiers\Ntime to pick up their stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.19,0:03:37.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I also gotta remember to breathe every\Nonce in a while or I'll pass out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.89,0:03:39.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a second, were you not?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.27,0:03:43.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's going to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.83,0:03:46.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does the sparkly old man, does he know me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.81,0:03:49.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, we've never met before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.23,0:03:53.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But jeez, he's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.31,0:03:55.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gonna get hurt out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.47,0:03:58.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess he does have\Na sword if he needs it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.09,0:04:01.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay focused, Noor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.57,0:04:03.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've just got to keep doing your part.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.61,0:04:34.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretty sure that sparkly gold old man is\Ngoing to get hurt if he stays out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.49,0:04:38.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, you must tell me who you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.09,0:04:40.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And why haven't you killed me yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.27,0:04:44.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, the poor guy thinks I\Ncame here to take him out?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.29,0:04:48.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess I can't really blame him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.73,0:04:52.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not that weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.63,0:04:53.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, don't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.71,0:04:56.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want him to be afraid of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.75,0:05:00.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to do something to reassure\Nhim, to let him know I'm not hostile.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.53,0:05:06.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this working?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.51,0:05:14.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope, guess not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.61,0:05:15.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't work at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.41,0:05:25.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm getting tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.75,0:05:29.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've really been going\Nnon-stop this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.47,0:05:33.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Low Heel can't do anything\Nto relieve exhaustion like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.79,0:05:45.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lynn, Inez, Rolo, I\Nhope you get out safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.49,0:05:48.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shooting Star!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.75,0:05:58.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.15,0:06:07.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drag race.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.07,0:06:19.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's you good to see you. Grill grizzly?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.25,0:06:25.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or glibbery? It's Gilbert.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.23,0:06:30.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.49,0:06:36.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice of you to finally join us, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.03,0:06:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.03,0:06:40.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, you're the...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.03,0:06:46.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do not know who you are, but thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.75,0:06:49.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will take care of the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.63,0:06:54.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must at least handle the clean-up,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.03,0:06:58.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or to abstain the honor of the\N6th Troop of the Royal Capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.65,0:07:06.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thousand Blades!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.97,0:07:11.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember! That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.57,0:07:14.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's the power of the swordsman!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.39,0:07:16.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one I've always dreamed of being!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.39,0:07:23.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.51,0:07:26.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And after I warned him\Nagainst any excessive killing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.67,0:07:27.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh-ho-ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.81,0:07:29.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a tall order, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.85,0:07:32.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Especially when we're faced\Nwith such a vast army.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.39,0:07:36.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, corpses will not\Nprovide us any needed intel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.35,0:07:39.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I find the living to be\Nimmensely more cooperative.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.29,0:07:43.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Especially after bringing back missing\Nlimbs over and over with healing magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.87,0:07:45.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.78,0:07:46.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.70,0:07:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it doesn't quite sound\Nlike a joke whenever you say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.69,0:07:53.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okun, they should be\Narriving any minute now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.01,0:07:54.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.17,0:07:56.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't have to tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.65,0:08:00.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have been strung along by the\Nenemy long enough for my taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.75,0:08:02.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's my time to shine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.09,0:08:26.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh-ho, their eyes are as red as fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.87,0:08:28.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You seem to be enjoying this, Oaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.01,0:08:30.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.39,0:08:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a good battle is always riveting no\Nmatter how long in the tooth I may get.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.19,0:08:37.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, shall we add the final touches?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.85,0:08:41.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soul prison!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.19,0:08:54.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's our turn now. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.39,0:09:01.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to save all the survivors and\Nmake them turn over a new leaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.91,0:09:04.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.07,0:09:08.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're the instructors who\Ntaught me at the training schools.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.11,0:09:16.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I'm\Ngetting to see them again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.19,0:09:23.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.23,0:09:24.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.27,0:09:27.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.31,0:09:28.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Noor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.51,0:09:37.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot, Lin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.13,0:09:39.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm feeling a lot better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.45,0:09:42.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, but are you sure you're okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.97,0:09:45.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should really rest a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.71,0:09:47.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, I've gotten enough rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.65,0:09:49.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I can move around again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.77,0:09:51.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am really hungry, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.55,0:09:55.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A commanding officer confessed\Nunder Sane's interrogation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.81,0:09:57.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They have no more troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.51,0:10:00.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They already threw everything\Nat us, including the dragon,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.45,0:10:03.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as well as all the other beasts\Nthat attacked the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.65,0:10:06.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm afraid the Emperor has escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.19,0:10:07.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Emperor?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.61,0:10:11.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That decrepit old fogey showed up\Nhere on the battlefield? He did.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.15,0:10:14.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must have been very\Nconfident in his chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.23,0:10:20.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dumb move for a guy who demands\Nhis people call him a wise ruler.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.41,0:10:22.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That old geezer must\Nbe losing his marbles.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.17,0:10:24.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Old geezer?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.21,0:10:25.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That terrified old gray fella?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.63,0:10:27.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.79,0:10:30.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know who we're\Ntalking about, young man?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.27,0:10:31.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.18,0:10:32.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just met a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.05,0:10:36.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was riding a horse all\Ndecked out in sparkly gold gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.45,0:10:38.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, he was hard to miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.17,0:10:39.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gold on his horse, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.03,0:10:43.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must have been employing\NOrichalcum's saddlery.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.89,0:10:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's very high-grade equipment that\Ncan support an extensive array of skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.65,0:10:52.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In which case, it makes sense\Nhow he escaped so quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.03,0:10:58.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But seriously wearing all gold, his\Nfashion sense is as shabby as his attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.59,0:11:01.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he escapes across the\Nborder, we cannot go after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.19,0:11:06.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a fortress and a heavily\Nguarded bridge that spans the ravine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.29,0:11:10.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no hope of catching up\Nto him by now with normal means.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.11,0:11:15.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only there was a way for us all to\Nfly together somehow. You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.49,0:11:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think that might actually be possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.59,0:11:19.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, son?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.47,0:11:23.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.53,0:11:25.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Assuming that it's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.83,0:11:33.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What an incredible sight\Nto behold. Being able to
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.41,0:11:35.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,see a legendary creature\Nup close and personal!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.87,0:11:39.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like this this makes living\Nto my old age worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.37,0:11:44.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Same here this must be the first time I've\Never been tasked with healing a dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.67,0:11:57.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, well, Noor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.33,0:12:01.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've really grown quite\Na lot, haven't you? Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.83,0:12:03.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't know it was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.33,0:12:05.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pardon?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.24,0:12:06.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This man?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.16,0:12:08.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is Noor you? That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.05,0:12:11.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It took me a few minutes to recognize him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.75,0:12:12.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.66,0:12:15.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Been a while since I've seen you. Ho-ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.09,0:12:18.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hadn't the slightest\Nidea it was you at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.15,0:12:21.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you're much larger\Nthan you used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.87,0:12:23.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad to see that you're still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.01,0:12:25.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.69,0:12:28.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is not a very nice\Nthing to say now, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.67,0:12:33.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is well within my abilities to live\Nanother hundred years or more easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.65,0:12:35.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you're still funny, too, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.05,0:12:38.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am not telling you a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.21,0:12:44.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But listen, Nor, are you sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.77,0:12:49.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Humans riding on the back of a dragon\Nseems like a terrible idea to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.59,0:12:51.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.75,0:12:53.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got Rolo with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.01,0:12:54.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.95,0:13:01.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well now, Rolo, my boy, are you\Nconfident in this ability of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.35,0:13:04.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.39,0:13:06.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no confidence at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.81,0:13:07.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, ho, ho.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.13,0:13:10.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.15,0:13:11.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can do this, Rolo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.45,0:13:17.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems our dragon is coming, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.97,0:13:18.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, yes, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.33,0:13:22.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you absolutely sure we\Nshould be riding a dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.67,0:13:23.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.58,0:13:24.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go for it, Rolo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.61,0:13:26.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.35,0:13:39.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.75,0:13:41.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems like it's angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.07,0:13:43.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.05,0:13:45.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only from how it sounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.41,0:13:47.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've lived in the mountains for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.25,0:13:51.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And wants to get revenge\Nagainst those who hurt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.03,0:13:54.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He would like you to order it to do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.83,0:13:55.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.95,0:13:59.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have that much communication\Nwith this large dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.95,0:14:00.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Extraordinary!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.86,0:14:02.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just extraordinary!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.79,0:14:04.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Rolo is a superstar.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.25,0:14:07.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm really not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.35,0:14:09.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This dragon thinks Norris...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.13,0:14:15.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It says it's ready to go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.75,0:14:16.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.73,0:14:19.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're going, get ready. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.39,0:14:25.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys are going with them as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.39,0:14:27.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.30,0:14:29.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rolo is the only one who\Ncan speak to the dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.47,0:14:31.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So he'll need as much help as he can get.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.29,0:14:34.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ines and I will go to guard him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.09,0:14:35.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be joining us too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.79,0:14:37.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.05,0:14:41.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I guess I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.99,0:14:47.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, well, I'm really\Nnot good with heights.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.17,0:14:51.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the one who came up with the idea,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.69,0:14:55.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I dragged Rolo into this, so it\Nwould be awkward now if I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.17,0:14:59.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But still, I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.51,0:15:05.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, sure, I'm going to.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.55,0:15:07.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.27,0:15:10.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Having you is like the\Nstrength of a hundred!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.13,0:15:12.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm coming as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.41,0:15:15.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must continue to look after my patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.51,0:15:19.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, I believe we\Nhave a duty to diplomacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.91,0:15:21.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.95,0:15:23.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't lump me in with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.85,0:15:27.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do not try to intimidate\Npeople with childish mischief.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.87,0:15:29.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, you're the...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.39,0:15:33.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thief instructor!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.85,0:15:35.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're coming too?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.31,0:15:36.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.45,0:15:41.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're going to fly on this giant beast,\Nthen you'll need the concealment skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.69,0:15:43.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can take care of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.75,0:15:44.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.55,0:15:47.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, I'm coming, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.49,0:15:50.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oaken, do you not need to\Nsupervise the stone cage?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.63,0:15:52.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.81,0:15:55.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will go as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.09,0:16:00.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe you will be in need of\Na negotiator. Father! Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.01,0:16:02.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you're safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.55,0:16:06.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you've been\Npretty worried about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.49,0:16:08.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad to see you're safe as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.85,0:16:12.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You chose to return\Ninstead of going to Mithra.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.15,0:16:17.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm willing to accept my\Npunishment for disobeying your order.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.89,0:16:18.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No need.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.05,0:16:22.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was my own fault for giving\Nyou such an idiotic command.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.93,0:16:25.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm relieved you made it back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.21,0:16:34.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, Rain, you are in charge of\Nmaking any judgment calls out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.59,0:16:37.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, Sir Noor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.45,0:16:41.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I apologize for always asking, but please.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.49,0:16:43.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take care of my kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.67,0:16:46.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, don't even worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.95,0:16:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll get them back safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.11,0:16:50.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.77,0:16:57.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.17,0:16:59.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.53,0:17:10.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you're okay with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.17,0:17:15.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, shouldn't you have\Nsaid something to Noor?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.57,0:17:19.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just finally found him after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.25,0:17:24.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fact is, he never really needed\Nus to play a role in his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.23,0:17:28.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The idea that we would be able\Nto take him in and raise him?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.25,0:17:31.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were showing our hubris.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.01,0:17:33.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right, no kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.65,0:17:36.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was like a hero born\Nstraight out of the legends.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.85,0:17:38.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel pretty silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.55,0:17:40.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now I
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.97,0:17:48.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am deeply ashamed of my own laziness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.07,0:17:55.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should not have been wasting time thinking\NI was in any position to teach others!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.61,0:18:00.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am going to retrain myself\Nfrom the beginning now
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.65,0:18:02.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that I've been made aware\Nof my own shortcomings.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.91,0:18:06.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cannot rest on my laurels\Nand let my sword rust.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.71,0:18:11.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For a guy who's deeply ashamed,\Nyou seem pretty darn happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.41,0:18:15.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But of course, just think of\Nthe spectacle he showed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.01,0:18:17.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, got that right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.03,0:18:21.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After seeing something\Nlike that, who wouldn't be?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.23,0:18:36.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Found anything? Nothing. Any luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.77,0:18:40.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there lady Lindbergh not a thing
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.51,0:18:52.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's faster than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.71,0:18:56.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Worst case, he may have already\Narrived back at the Empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.93,0:19:04.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beyond that steel bridge, the land\Nturns into Empire-controlled territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.37,0:19:06.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We cannot just wildly rush in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.05,0:19:11.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know we've come a long way, but\Nperhaps we should consider going back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.45,0:19:12.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your call.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.95,0:19:14.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me think, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.67,0:19:16.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.77,0:19:18.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something is moving extremely fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.03,0:19:24.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is definitely him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.89,0:19:28.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although he's nearing the\NImperial Capital's defenses.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.65,0:19:32.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we cross into their land, we\Nwill not make it back in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.39,0:19:34.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now, we are still\Nconcealed from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.45,0:19:36.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once they become aware of our presence,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.01,0:19:40.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the magic will of course\Nimmediately lose its effectiveness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.29,0:19:43.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's true, but letting\Nhim escape is not an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.41,0:19:48.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They have powerful magical tools and can\Nuse them to reinforce their military power.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.05,0:19:52.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We cannot give them any\Nopportunity to make that happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.29,0:19:57.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, he's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.51,0:19:59.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are already at war.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.51,0:20:03.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, we have no idea what awaits us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.81,0:20:04.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord Rain,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.03,0:20:07.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lady Lindbergh, if I may,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.69,0:20:11.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would like you to grant me\Npermission to obliterate this area.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.37,0:20:13.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Obliterate?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.37,0:20:15.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this is going to be\Nour escape route later,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.89,0:20:20.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then it would be smart to take out the\Ndefenses while we have the opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.91,0:20:25.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In normal situations, Ines would\Nnever suggest exerting her own power.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.49,0:20:28.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But she is just as\Nangry as the rest of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.59,0:20:32.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The royal capital she vowed to risk\Nher life to protect has been flattened.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.59,0:20:33.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.50,0:20:36.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do as you please, Inez,\Nand do not hold back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.83,0:20:38.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.11,0:20:44.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Divine sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.59,0:21:03.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.83,0:21:09.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe that will secure our\Nescape route, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.73,0:21:10.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.64,0:21:11.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well done, Ines.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.41,0:21:13.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lynne!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.11,0:21:17.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our actions here will determine\Nthe course of the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.69,0:21:21.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are going to keep pursuing the Emperor\Nall the way to the Imperial Capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.87,0:21:23.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you're ready for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.93,0:21:24.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.45,0:21:30.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone here wields power\Nfar outside the norm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.93,0:21:33.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are the strongest people imaginable.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.15,0:21:36.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no need to worry about anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.17,0:21:41.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plus, above all, we have Sir Noor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.47,0:21:45.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cannot even begin to\Ncomprehend his greatness.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.29,0:21:49.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even now, he quietly\Nlistens to all around him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.65,0:21:51.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he knows the weight of this moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.71,0:21:55.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We shall teach them a\Nhard lesson about what
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.47,0:21:58.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,happens when you mess\Nwith the wrong people.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:05.06,0:22:10.02,Freehand 471 BT,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs37}#10 I Parry the Emperor's Authority
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.19,0:22:12.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.31,0:23:11.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.

